<view class="page-shell create-page">
  <view class="eyebrow">MEETFAIR · 一起选地点</view>
  <view class="page-title">这次，大家想怎么聚？</view>
  <view class="page-copy">先建房分享给朋友，大家再各自填写出发位置。满 2 人后开始推荐。</view>

  <view class="form-block">
    <view class="field-label">聚会名称</view>
    <input class="title-input" value="{{title}}" maxlength="18" bindinput="setTitle" placeholder="例如：周五晚饭局"/>
  </view>

  <view class="form-block">
    <view class="field-label">想要什么样的地点（选填）</view>
    <input class="title-input" value="{{preferenceText}}" maxlength="60" bindinput="setPreferenceText" placeholder="例如：安静、有包间、停车方便" />
    <view class="prototype-tip">当前识别“安静、包间、停车”三类词，仅在地图资料有明确线索时参与同等通勤候选的排序。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="form-block">
    <view class="field-label">想做什么</view>
    <view class="category-grid">
      <view wx:for="{{categories}}" wx:key="id" class="category-item {{activeCategory === item.id ? 'category-active' : ''}}" bindtap="selectCategory" data-id="{{item.id}}">
        <text class="category-icon">{{item.icon}}</text><text>{{item.label}}</text>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="form-block">
    <view class="field-label">聚会时间</view>
    <view class="meeting-time-row">
      <picker mode="date" value="{{meetingDate}}" start="{{minDate}}" bindchange="selectMeetingDate">
        <view class="meeting-time-picker">{{meetingDate}}</view>
      </picker>
      <picker mode="time" value="{{meetingTime}}" bindchange="selectMeetingTime">
        <view class="meeting-time-picker">{{meetingTime}}</view>
      </picker>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="form-block">
    <view class="field-label">位置数据保留多久</view>
    <picker mode="selector" range="{{retentionOptions}}" range-key="label" value="{{retentionIndex}}" bindchange="selectRetention">
      <view class="meeting-time-picker">{{retentionOptions[retentionIndex].label}}</view>
    </picker>
  </view>

  <view class="prototype-tip">创建时无需填写位置。加入后各自选择出发点；位置仅保留所选期限，大致位置不会上传精确坐标。</view>
  <button class="primary-button create-button" disabled="{{creating}}" bindtap="createRoom">{{creating ? '正在创建…' : '创建聚会并邀请'}}</button>
</view>
